msgctxt "[\"PCSX2\",\"Crowdin UI\",\"\",\"2927\",\"e3db6c3c157131d95faa3561\"]"
msgid "Displays the newest frame immediately at the beginning of the frame raster time, instead of at the end. Can reduce perceived input lag, but may cause problems with some games, such as Soulcalibur II and Baldur&apos;s Gate Dark Alliance II. "
